/E (Economic growth in the region has averaged around 5% per year, but this has not kept pace with the fast-growing youth population. Many young people remain underemployed, and rural communities face poor roads, weak trade logistics, and the growing impact of climate change from droughts to floods.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
872 0 obj
<<
